OL,3,GNEWSAMan caught in car with #14k of
OL,4,Adrugs as a lamb ate chips in the back
OL,5,Aseat avoids jail
OL,6,
OL,7,FA man who was caught in a car with
OL,8,F#14,000 of drugs, while a lamb ate from
OL,9,Fa bag of chips in the back seat, has
OL,10,Favoided jail.
OL,12,FJohn McNeil, 56, was a passenger in
OL,13,FLindsey Sangster's vehicle which was
OL,14,Fstopped by police on the M74 in Glasgow
OL,15,Fon 22 April 2023.
OL,17,FBags of heroin and cocaine were later
OL,18,Frecovered by a police dog underneath
OL,19,Fthe front passenger seat of the
OL,20,FVolkswagen Golf.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
