OL,3,GNEWSAMan caught in car with #14k of
OL,4,Adrugs as a lamb ate chips in the back
OL,5,Aseat avoids jail
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhen quizzed about the animal - called
OL,8,FPablo - a sergeant claimed Sangster's
OL,9,Fpartner McNeil told him she was a
OL,10,F"trainee shepherdess." The duo were
OL,11,Ffound guilty in September of possession
OL,12,Fof heroin and diamorphine with intent
OL,13,Fto supply.
